  "text": "[calm]  The one layer with ruled, mortared joints. The loop is parked here, deliberately. Its way of working was distilled into a skill and pointed at real work. The shape, on the card: a worker does one task, returns a small report; an orchestrator independently verifies, writes the ledger, replans every step — and stops for a human only at genuine decisions. The skill's own advice: copy it; don't reinvent the return channel. [short pause] First big target: the map you just watched evolve. Forty-four tasks, two days; interrupted runs resumed from the ledger as if nothing happened. [pause] It caught the second thing the inside couldn't see: the hierarchy had gone flat.  Single-exhibit rooms, ninety-six rows crowding the front door; a sweep folded them home — down to sixty-two. The discipline it obeyed — deepen before detach — was seeded back in June; it landed here, as this layer's work. [short pause] Then it built the talk you watched before this one. I did not plan that symmetry. I only kept the notes.",
